# The index stores every text file with LF, but a Windows/WSL checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites them to CRLF on the way out. That breaks shell
# scripts outright (`/bin/bash^M: bad interpreter`), makes `.env` files
# unsourceable, and corrupts the Maven wrapper, so pin the working tree to LF
# regardless of the machine's git config.
#
# This is repo-wide policy: frontend/ keeps its own copy so it stays
# self-contained if extracted, and both agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures: never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.gz    binary
*.br    binary
*.jar   binary
